lished by Nine Circles Corporation, filed "><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://gameaichecker.com/images/steam/apps/5099430/0a616f0fb04b6546-full.webp?v=gallery1"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"VideoGame","name":"The Rhapsody of Zephyr Remastered","url":"https://gameaichecker.com/games/5099430-the-rhapsody-of-zephyr-remastered/","image":["https://gameaichecker.com/images/steam/apps/5099430/0a616f0fb04b6546-full.webp?v=gallery1","https://gameaichecker.com/images/steam/apps/5099430/08e7bd8c180c64e8-full.webp?v=gallery1","https://gameaichecker.com/images/steam/apps/5099430/f4e94aebb43ac05b-full.webp?v=gallery1","https://gameaichecker.com/images/steam/apps/5099430/8a0545499be86f5b-full.webp?v=gallery1"],"description":"The remaster of The War of Genesis side story The Rhapsody of Zephyr, released on Sep 18, 2026, developed and published by Nine Circles Corporation, filed under RPG, and sold on HD 16:9 widescreen support, full voice acting and quality-of-life improvements. The Steam AI disclosure is written in Korean and keeps the use narrow: character and background graphic assets, upscaling done to improve the quality of the video sequences embedded in the game, and background resource expansion to fit a widescreen ratio, all described as limited use. This site records art as used on those three items and records the other seven areas as not addressed, including voice, because the disclosure does not mention it while the store description separately advertises full voice acting; both sentences are logged as written and neither is adjudicated. A Korean review from inthegamer describes the picture as AI-upscaled original assets, which points the same way, and this site still decides the area from the disclosure text.","applicationCategory":"RPG","operatingSystem":"Windows","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Nine Circles Corporation"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Nine Circles Corporation"},"datePubl